>
> {ua je'e} Well, I'd still strongly prefer for it to be monosyllabic...
perhaps {iau}?

There are lots of cmavo one would prefer to be monosyllabic, with vau'u far
from the top of the list, and the BPFK will need to decide firstly whether
to recycle any formerly assigned monosyllabic cmavo and secondly which
available monosyllabic cmavo forms to assign to which candidate functions.

Until that happens, you should always choose a disyllabic experimental
cmavo so that its usage frequency isn't distorted by its temporary
monosyllabicity.

